LSM capability,landlock
HELLO supervisor
HELLO shell_agent
HELLO doc_agent
ERROR shell_agent open /usr/lib64 errno=2
ALLOW doc_agent write /tmp/doc/benign.txt
TRY shell_agent execve /tmp/payload.sh
DENY doc_agent write /tmp/payload.sh errno=13
DENY shell_agent execve /tmp/payload.sh errno=13
DENY doc_agent execve /tmp/payload.sh EACCES
TRY shell_agent execve /bin/true
DONE doc_agent
DONE supervisor
